  "prefLabel": "Puc 1605.03 Publication of Proposed Tariff Change",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 1605.03 Publication of Proposed Tariff Change. When a utility proposes a service or tariff change pursuant to this part, it shall publish notice of the proposed service or tariff change pursuant to the requirements set forth in Puc 1604.03.\n\nSource. #6573, eff 9-10-97; ss #8428, eff 9-10-05; ss by #10535, eff 3-4-14; ss by #14030, eff 7-25-24",
